==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Wood Pigeon}}
Wood Pigeons are a common variety of [[Pigeon]].<ref name="CaC 164"/> Their bodies are gray in color, though their head has purple feathers. They can be found all throughout [[Hyrule]], typically inhabiting forests, grasslands, and villages. Due to their lack of awareness, Wood Pigeons are mostly hunted by amateur hunters.<ref name="BotW Hyrule Compendium 2"/> When killed, Wood Pigeons drop [[Raw Bird Drumstick]]s.

